        },
        {
          "step_id": "tile_stakeholder_prioritizing_framing_context.s09",
          "type": "explainer",
          "concept_ids": [
            "stakeholder.narrative_context_setup"
          ],
          "eyebrow": "Narrative Context",
          "title": "Start with why: set the context before the findings",
          "lede": "Before the Head of Operations reads any finding about Lagos delivery times, they need to know why they are reading this report at all.",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "prose",
              "block_id": "tile_stakeholder_prioritizing_framing_context.s09.b1",
              "role": "intro",
              "text": "Before the Head of Operations reads any finding about Lagos delivery times, they need to know why they are reading this report at all. Dropping straight into numbers without context leaves the reader to guess the purpose of the analysis.",
              "lineage": {
                "concept_ids": [
                  "stakeholder.narrative_context_setup"
                ],
                "teaching_block_ids": [
                  "stakeholder.narrative_context_setup#tb1"
                ],
                "fact_ids": []
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "prose",
              "block_id": "tile_stakeholder_prioritizing_framing_context.s09.b2",
              "role": "definition",
              "text": "In a story's structure, the beginning establishes the context: what is happening, or what the situation is, when the story begins. A summary should have an obvious beginning, middle, and end; the beginning level-sets the audience before diving into the analysis.",
              "lineage": {
                "concept_ids": [
                  "stakeholder.narrative_context_setup"
                ],
                "teaching_block_ids": [
                  "stakeholder.narrative_context_setup#tb2"
                ],
                "fact_ids": [
                  "stakeholder.narrative_context_setup#f1",
                  "stakeholder.narrative_context_setup#f2"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "prose",
              "block_id": "tile_stakeholder_prioritizing_framing_context.s09.b3",
              "role": "mechanism",
              "text": "A report should not start with lengthy background or technical definitions. Instead, include a short paragraph explaining what the publication is about, with more detailed information placed in a separate section. For the delivery report: \"This report looks at delivery times across our three cities last quarter\" — not a page of methodology before the findings.",
              "lineage": {
                "concept_ids": [
                  "stakeholder.narrative_context_setup"
                ],
                "teaching_block_ids": [
                  "stakeholder.narrative_context_setup#tb3"
                ],
                "fact_ids": [
                  "stakeholder.narrative_context_setup#f3"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "prose",
              "block_id": "tile_stakeholder_prioritizing_framing_context.s09.b4",
              "role": "practical_context",
              "text": "Explaining why the statistics have been collected includes relevant, factual information about the policy and operational context. Noting that this review was prompted by rising customer complaints about Lagos deliveries gives the reader a reason the analysis exists at all.",
              "lineage": {
                "concept_ids": [
                  "stakeholder.narrative_context_setup"
                ],
                "teaching_block_ids": [
                  "stakeholder.narrative_context_setup#tb4"
                ],
                "fact_ids": [
                  "stakeholder.narrative_context_setup#f4"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "before_after",
              "block_id": "tile_stakeholder_prioritizing_framing_context.s09.b5",
              "before": {
                "type": "diagram",
                "diagram_kind": "container",
                "title": "Weak opener (lengthy background)",
                "nodes": [
                  {
                    "id": "weak_opener",
                    "label": "QuickShip was founded in 2019 and operates across three Nigerian cities. The company uses a proprietary routing algorithm. Delivery times are measured from order placement to doorstep arrival. This report uses SQL queries on the orders table and an Excel driver roster...",
                    "kind": "text_block"
                  }
                ],
                "alt_text": "A text block showing a weak opener that buries the purpose in lengthy background: company history, technical definitions, and methodology before stating what the report is about."
              },
              "after": {
                "type": "diagram",
                "diagram_kind": "container",
                "title": "Strong opener (short context section)",
                "nodes": [
                  {
                    "id": "strong_opener",
                    "label": "This report examines delivery times across Lagos, Kano, and Abuja last quarter, prompted by rising customer complaints about Lagos deliveries. It answers: which zones are missing the 25-minute target, and by how much?",
                    "kind": "text_block"
                  }
                ],
                "alt_text": "A text block showing a strong two-sentence opener: one sentence states what the report covers and why it was done; the second names the specific question it answers — no lengthy background."
              },
              "change_summary": "Two sentences replace a paragraph of background. The strong opener immediately level-sets the reader on what the report covers, why the analysis was done, and what question it answers.",
              "lineage": {
