              "text": "Lead with the finding most relevant to the stakeholder's decision, not the most analytically interesting one. Use the inverted pyramid: most important first, everything else from most to least important. Pair each finding with a distinct recommendation that names the action and the explicit ask. Open the report with a short context section that states what it covers, why the analysis was done, and what question it answers.",
